<title>UK: Allied Colloids chairman retires.</title>
<headline>Allied Colloids chairman retires.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Industrial chemicals firm Allied Colloids said on Friday that Trevor Holdsworth had retired as chairman and director of the company.</p>
<p>In a statement, it said that Bruce Farmer had been appointed chairman with effect from Friday.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
